OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CToday:FA grey morning for most, with   
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain across western       
OL,7,Fcounties to start. The rain slowly     
OL,8,Fprogresses eastwards but becomes       
OL,9,Flighter and patchier throughout the    
OL,10,Fafternoon. Feeling cool with a brisk   
OL,11,Fsoutheasterly wind, milder across the  
OL,12,Fsouthwest.                             
OL,14,CTonight:FCloudy and dry for most, a    
OL,15,Ffew breaks in the cloud develop across 
OL,16,FKent, while rain affects western       
OL,17,Fcounties later in the night. Becoming  
OL,18,Fwindy along the coast by morning.      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
