OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CSaturday:FWestern counties bearing the 
OL,6,Fbrunt of the rain, with some heavy and 
OL,7,Fprolonged periods. While eastern       
OL,8,Fcounties remain largely dry until      
OL,9,Flater in the afternoon. Windy,         
OL,10,Fespecially along coasts.               
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny   
OL,13,Ffor most of Sunday once rain clears    
OL,14,Fthe far east. Cloudy periods but dry   
OL,15,Fon Monday. Rain moves in from the      
OL,16,Fnorthwest Tuesday afternoon. Above     
OL,17,Faverage temperatures.                  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
